<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Boykin Lodging started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Boykin Lodging started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Lehman Brothers said it initiated coverage of Boykin Lodging Inc with a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- Further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- The stock was up 1/8 at 20-1/2.</p>
